WEBVTT

00:18:59.583 --> 00:19:02.143
even to things
he didn't feel qualified for.

00:19:02.167 --> 00:19:04.976
He kept waking up at 4am sweating.

00:19:05.000 --> 00:19:07.768
His doctor told him
he had symptoms of hypertension.

00:19:07.792 --> 00:19:09.559
AR: My doctor's like, this is weird.

00:19:09.583 --> 00:19:11.536
You're very young, you're in great shape.

00:19:11.560 --> 00:19:14.851
There's something wrong here.
Like you need to make some adjustments.

00:19:14.875 --> 00:19:17.184
I thought, hey, this place
is the problem, right?

00:19:17.208 --> 00:19:19.143
I just need a new place and I'll be fine

00:19:19.167 --> 00:19:21.809
and I remember telling a friend,

00:19:21.833 --> 00:19:25.851
"If I'm not out of this company
by January 1 of next year,

00:19:25.875 --> 00:19:29.059
I want you to come find me
and I want you to punch me in the face."

00:19:29.083 --> 00:19:32.018
AG: Alexi did leave
and started his own company,